#. FIXME: why do we have dual & boolean API. This is not consistent!
#: libwnck/wnckprop.c:941 libwnck/wnckprop.c:950 libwnck/wnckprop.c:959
#: libwnck/wnckprop.c:966 libwnck/wnckprop.c:976 libwnck/wnckprop.c:983
